# A test run that imports the adapter WRITES these into the source tree:
# config.json is generated with a fresh bearer, and a key pair appears on
# first use. Neither belongs in a published skill, and the push guard caught
# the config before it left the machine (2026-08-19).
voice-agent/src/config.json
voice-agent/src/state.json
voice-agent/src/agent-x25519.*
